{"articleNo":"84333","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=84333&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 하반기(11기) 낙산초등학교 TaLK 내국인장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.04","hit":"3339","attachments":[{"name":"2.+모집+선발+계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=84333&attachNo=71690"},{"name":"3.+지원서+및+학습지도안.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=84333&attachNo=71736"},{"name":"1.낙산초등학교+TaLK11기+모집+선발+공고문 (1).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=84333&attachNo=71767"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN: 0pt 2pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">낙산초등학교에서는 외국인장학생과 함께 방과후 영어수업을 협력하여 지도할 내국인 장학생을 모집하고 있사오니, 관심있는 학생들의 많은 지원 바랍니다. </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 2pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">공 고 문</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 모집 영역 및 인원 : 11기 TaLK 내국인장학생 1명</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 근무 조건</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 활동 기간 : 2013. 09. 01. ？ 2014. 02. 28.(6개월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 본인이 희망하고 특별한 문제가 없을 경우 6개월씩 최장 2년까지 연장 가능(최우수 평가자에 한해 예외적으로 2년 추가 연장)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 강의 시간 및 강사료</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) 강의 시간 : 주 9시간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) 강사료 : 시간당 14,000원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 지원 자격</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 지역에 대한 사랑과 봉사정신이 투철한 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 신체 및 정신이 건강한 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 국내 대학 재학생(휴학생 포함), 졸업생</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 교육대학, 사범대학/교직이수자(영어 전공자) 우대</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 영어로 의사소통이 가능한 자(영어 성적 제출 필) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 평점평균이 3.2/4.5 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">바. TaLK 오리엔테에션에 참여할 수 있는 자(일정 추후 통보</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(2013.7월~8경 국립국제교육원, 도교육청주관 2번 연수 참석)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 지원서 접수</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 접수기간: ‘13. 06. 03(월) ~ 06. 21(금) ※ 학교 도착분에 한함</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 접 수 처: 낙산초등학교 교무실(☎ 054-976-1603)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">다. 접수방법: 개별접수, 학교와 사전 전화 문의 후 우편접수 가능</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 구비서류</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">지원서 1부(사진 첨부, 자기건강보고서, 자기소개서, 활동계획서)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) 학습지도안 1부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 첨부</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">서식으로 작성, 초등학교 방과후학교 지도용으로 작성, 주제 및 내용은 초등학생의 수준 고려)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) 봉인 추천서 1부 : 학과장, 지도교수 또는 소속 학과 교수 추천 </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: 휴먼명조\">※ 추천인 연락처 및 서명 등재</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">4) 봉인 성적증명서 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">5) 공인 어학능력시험 성적(제출 필) 1부</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 취득일자 및 성적기준 점수 상관없이 토익, 텝스, 토플, IELTs 중 택 1이상 반드시 제출</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40pt\" class=\"본문\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 결과 발표</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">가. 발 표 일 : 2013년 6월 28일(금)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">나. 발표방법 : 개별 통보</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ 기타 문의사항은 낙산초등학교 교무실(☎ 054-976-1603)로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013년 6월 3일</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-TOP: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 0p